# LEARNER C, FOUR TOWNS STEPPED IN PARALLEL, ACTION REPEAT 2, c0's EXPERT ROWS PINNED, 2M DECISIONS (user
# 2026-11-12: "build it" -- the parallel actors --, "can we add more towns", "then deploy on another l40").
# = slurm/cluster_frl_c0emb_t05t01_ar2_xp_2m.env (the same learner, reward, expert replay and 2M budget) with:
#   - ENV_TOWNS=Town05,Town01,Town04,Town10HD: c0's four training towns (Town02/Town03 stay held out), one env
#     and one CARLA server each;
#   - FRL_PARALLEL=1: the four stepped at once (torch_rl/frl/carla.train_parallel); per transition the learner
#     is unchanged -- one update (256 split into 8) per transition, the entropy anneal per transition;
#   - FRL_REPLAY_DEVICE=cuda: the replay (~5 GB) on the L40 instead of the host; same rows, same sampling.
# Validation stays Town05 + Town01, the declared rule.
. "$REPO/slurm/cluster_frl_c0emb_t05t01_ar2_xp_2m.env"
export ENV_TOWNS=Town05,Town01,Town04,Town10HD
export FRL_PARALLEL=1 FRL_REPLAY_DEVICE=cuda
